        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Radio Bam, Sirius Radio\n- People: Bam Margera, April Margera, Phillip \"Phil\" Margera\n- Roles: American reality television personality\n- Products: Viva La Bam, CKY Videos, Jackass\n\nFacts:\n- Radio Bam, also called Bam Radio, was a Sirius Radio station that aired on Mondays at 7pm.\n- Radio Bam frequently featured guest appearances by April Margera and Phillip \"Phil\" Margera.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera was born on July 13, 1957.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera is an American reality television personality.\n- Phillip \"Phil\" Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY Videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.",
