        "original_id": "93401b2d-08e4-590b-9d26-0e5c6bb01899",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Margera, Bam Margera, Brandon Dicamillo, Brandon Novak, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, Chris Raab, April Margera, Don Vito\n- Projects: Radio Bam, CKY, Jackass, Viva La Bam, CKY Videos\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Margera was born on July 13, 1957.\n- Phil Margera is an American reality television personality.\n- Phil Margera is best known for appearing on Viva La Bam, the CKY Videos, and the Jackass television series and movies.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, the show's supporting cast originally included Bam Margera's fellow CKY crew members Brandon Dicamillo and Brandon Novak, who appeared on most episodes.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, Ryan Dunn, Rake Yohn, and Chris Raab made frequent guest appearances.\n- In the early years of Radio Bam, Bam Margera's parents April Margera and Phil Margera, his uncle Don Vito, and members of the Jackass crew also appeared occasionally.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
